    "q-160879": {
      "dom_id": "step-q160879",
      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "$(-5)÷(-8)$ is equivalent to",
      "worked_solution": "We have to divide a negative number $(-5)$ by another negative number $(-8).$ So the result will be positive:\n\n$$\n(-5)÷(-8)=\\boxed{}\n$$\n\nTo write down the number that goes in the box, recall that \n\n$$\n5÷8=\\frac{5}{8}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we get\n\n$$\n(-5)÷(-8)=\\frac{5}{8}.\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
